  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Version: Build 994\n\nDescription of the bug: A majority of avatars are hidden with the 'Very Poor' avatar, seems to be caused by No Limits option being chosen in 'Maximum Avatar Download Size'\n\nSteps to reproduce: Just launching VRChat having 'Maximum Avatar Download Size' set to No Limit and going into a world. Video of Issue (WARNING: Music Playing): https://streamable.com/tvcqxt\n\nTemp Fix: Changing the minimum avatar file size and changing it back to No Limit seems to fix the issue for that instance of the game. Another temp fix would be just to set the Download Size to something very high.",
